--- subject
Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled
--- html
<p>Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p>{{ if reason == "customer" }}As you asked, we cancelled order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ else if reason == "support" }}Our support team cancelled order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ else if reason == "checkout_expired" }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled because the payment was not completed in time.{{ else if reason == "late_payment" }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled because your payment arrived after the order expired.{{ else if reason == "checkout_failed" }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled because the checkout failed.{{ else }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled.{{ end }}</p>
<p><a href="{{ orderUrl }}">View your order</a></p>
--- text
Hi {{ name }},

{{ if reason == "customer" }}As you asked, we cancelled order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ else if reason == "support" }}Our support team cancelled order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ else if reason == "checkout_expired" }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled because the payment was not completed in time.{{ else if reason == "late_payment" }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled because your payment arrived after the order expired.{{ else if reason == "checkout_failed" }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled because the checkout failed.{{ else }}Order {{ orderNumber }} was cancelled.{{ end }}

View your order: {{ orderUrl }}
